  "slides": [
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden bg-[#0d0d0d] text-[#ececec]\" data-slide-title=\"OpenAI API — Developer Overview\" data-slide-type=\"title\" style=\"font-family:Inter, sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-[12px] bg-[#10a37f]\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute left-[12px] top-0 h-full w-[112px] border-r border-[#282828] px-5 py-8\" style=\"writing-mode:vertical-rl;\">\n<div class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#10a37f]\">Developer overview</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-[160px] flex h-full flex-col justify-between px-14 py-14\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#8e8e8e]\">\n<span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#10a37f]\"></span>\n      OpenAI platform / mid-2026\n    </div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1fr_530px] items-center gap-12\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"mb-5 text-[16px] font-medium text-[#10a37f]\">A practical field guide for builders</div>\n<h1 class=\"max-w-[600px] text-[58px] font-semibold leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.05em]\" style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\">OpenAI API —<br/>Developer Overview</h1>\n<p class=\"mt-7 max-w-[520px] text-[20px] leading-8 text-[#a8a8a8]\">Models, endpoints, and patterns<br/>for production applications · Mid-2026</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#303030] bg-[#1a1a1a] p-6 shadow-2xl\">\n<div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center justify-between text-[12px] text-[#777]\">\n<span>quickstart.sh</span><span class=\"text-[#10a37f]\">● connected</span>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"m-0 whitespace-pre-wrap text-[15px] leading-7 text-[#d7d7d7]\" style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\"><span class=\"text-[#6b8afd]\">curl</span> https://api.openai.com/v1/responses \\\n  -H <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"Authorization: Bearer $OPENAI_API_KEY\"</span> \\\n  -H <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"Content-Type: application/json\"</span> \\\n  -d <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">'{\n    \"model\": \"gpt-5.5\",\n    \"input\": \"Hello, world\"\n  }'</span></pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[#282828] pt-5 text-[12px] text-[#737373]\">\n<span>01 / 10</span><span>Responses-first · composable · observable</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden bg-[#0d0d0d] text-[#ececec]\" data-slide-title=\"Platform at a glance\" data-slide-type=\"content\" style=\"font-family:Inter, sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-[12px] bg-[#10a37f]\"></div>\n<aside class=\"absolute left-[12px] top-0 h-full w-[112px] border-r border-[#282828] px-5 py-8\"><div class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#10a37f]\" style=\"writing-mode:vertical-rl;\">Platform</div></aside>\n<main class=\"ml-[160px] px-14 py-12\">\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\">\n<div><div class=\"mb-3 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#10a37f]\">02 / surfaces</div><h2 class=\"text-[42px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]\" style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\">One platform, several entry points.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-[17px] text-[#929292]\">Start with Responses; reach for specialized APIs when the workload demands it.</p></div>\n<div class=\"rounded-full border border-[#285e50] px-4 py-2 text-[12px] text-[#72c98b]\">API surface map</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-10 grid grid-cols-4 gap-3\">\n<div class=\"col-span-2 rounded-xl border border-[#10a37f] bg-[#10231f] p-5\"><div class=\"text-[12px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#72c98b]\">Primary interface</div><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[23px] font-semibold\">Responses API</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#a9bdb6]\">Unified input, state, tools, structured outputs, and streaming.</p></div>\n<div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#303030] p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-[18px] font-semibold\">Chat Completions</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#909090]\">Compatible standard</p></div>\n<div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#303030] p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-[18px] font-semibold\">Realtime API</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#909090]\">Voice/audio · WebRTC · WebSocket · SIP</p></div>\n<div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#303030] p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-[18px] font-semibold\">Embeddings</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#909090]\">Search, retrieval, ranking</p></div>\n<div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#303030] p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-[18px] font-semibold\">Images</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#909090]\">Generation and editing</p></div>\n<div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#303030] p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-[18px] font-semibold\">Batch</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#909090]\">Asynchronous workloads</p></div>\n<div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#303030] p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-[18px] font-semibold\">Administration</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#909090]\">Organization controls</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-8 rounded-xl bg-[#1a1a1a] px-6 py-5\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666]\">Endpoint index</div><pre class=\"m-0 text-[15px] leading-7\" style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\"><span class=\"rounded bg-[#10a37f] px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-[#07130f]\">POST</span> /v1/responses    <span class=\"rounded bg-[#10a37f] px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-[#07130f]\">POST</span> /v1/chat/completions    <span class=\"rounded bg-[#10a37f] px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-[#07130f]\">POST</span> /v1/embeddings\n<span class=\"rounded bg-[#10a37f] px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-[#07130f]\">POST</span> /v1/images/generations    <span class=\"rounded bg-[#10a37f] px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-[#07130f]\">POST</span> /v1/batches</pre></div>\n</main>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden bg-[#0d0d0d] text-[#ececec]\" data-slide-title=\"Model lineup\" data-slide-type=\"content\" style=\"font-family:Inter, sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-[12px] bg-[#10a37f]\"></div><aside class=\"absolute left-[12px] top-0 h-full w-[112px] border-r border-[#282828] px-5 py-8\"><div class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#10a37f]\" style=\"writing-mode:vertical-rl;\">Models</div></aside>\n<main class=\"ml-[160px] px-14 py-12\">\n<div class=\"mb-7\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#10a37f]\">03 / selection</div><h2 class=\"text-[42px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]\" style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\">Choose by workload, not hype.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-[17px] text-[#929292]\">The production default is the flagship; smaller variants optimize latency and spend.</p></div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.55fr_0.9fr] gap-8\">\n<div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[#303030]\">\n<table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-left text-[13px]\"><thead class=\"bg-[#1a1a1a] text-[#777]\"><tr><th class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium\">Family</th><th class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium\">Best fit</th><th class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium\">Known profile</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"text-[#c5c5c5]\"><tr class=\"border-t border-[#303030] bg-[#10231f]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#72c98b]\">GPT-5.5</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Production recommendation</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">~1M context · 128K output</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[#303030]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\">GPT-5.4 + mini/nano</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">General tasks to low-latency routing</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Tier by reasoning need</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[#303030]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\">gpt-image-2 / gpt-image-1</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Image generation and edits</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Images surface</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[#303030]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\">GPT-Realtime-2</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Voice and audio interaction</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Realtime surface</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[#303030]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\">Embeddings models</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Retrieval and semantic search</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Vector representations</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[#303030]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\">Open-weight models</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Self-managed deployments</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Apache 2.0</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#303030] bg-[#151515] p-5\"><div class=\"mb-2 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#777]\">GPT-5.5 price signal</div><div class=\"mb-2 text-[13px] text-[#9a9a9a]\">USD per 1M tokens · listed values</div><canvas height=\"250\" id=\"chart-a4c91e\" width=\"410\"></canvas><div class=\"mt-3 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#777]\">Output tokens are priced at 6× input tokens. Use model tiering and caching to control the multiplier.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-5 text-[11px] text-[#666]\">Footnote: older GPT-5 and o3 snapshots are deprecated December 2026.</div>\n</main>\n<script>(() => { const canvas = document.querySelector('#chart-a4c91e'); if (!canvas) return; new Chart(canvas, { type: 'bar', data: { labels: ['Input', 'Output'], datasets: [{ data: [5, 30], backgroundColor: ['#10a37f','#72c98b'], borderRadius: 5, barThickness: 42 }] }, options: { responsive: false, animation: false, scales: { y: { beginAtZero: true, grid: { color: '#303030' }, ticks: { color: '#888', callback: v => '$' + v } }, x: { grid: { display: false }, ticks: { color: '#bbb' } } }, plugins: { legend: { display: false }, title: { display: true, text: 'GPT-5.5 listed price · USD / 1M tokens', color: '#ececec', align: 'start', font: { size: 14 } }, datalabels: { color: '#ececec', anchor: 'end', align: 'end', formatter: v => '$' + v } } } }); })();</script>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden bg-[#0d0d0d] text-[#ececec]\" data-slide-title=\"Authentication and setup\" data-slide-type=\"content\" style=\"font-family:Inter, sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-[12px] bg-[#10a37f]\"></div><aside class=\"absolute left-[12px] top-0 h-full w-[112px] border-r border-[#282828] px-5 py-8\"><div class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#10a37f]\" style=\"writing-mode:vertical-rl;\">Setup</div></aside>\n<main class=\"ml-[160px] px-14 py-12\"><div class=\"mb-8\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#10a37f]\">04 / auth</div><h2 class=\"text-[42px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]\" style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\">Make the first call boring.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-[17px] text-[#929292]\">Keep credentials outside source control; let the SDK handle request construction.</p></div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25fr_0.75fr] gap-8\">\n<div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#303030] bg-[#1a1a1a] p-7\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex justify-between text-[12px] text-[#777]\"><span>quickstart.py</span><span class=\"text-[#10a37f]\">Python SDK</span></div><pre class=\"m-0 text-[16px] leading-7\" style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\"><span class=\"text-[#777]\"># pip install openai</span>\n<span class=\"text-[#6b8afd]\">import</span> os\n<span class=\"text-[#6b8afd]\">from</span> openai <span class=\"text-[#6b8afd]\">import</span> OpenAI\n\nclient = OpenAI(api_key=os.environ[<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"</span>])\n\nresponse = client.responses.create(\n    model=<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"gpt-5.5\"</span>,\n    input=<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"Explain vector embeddings in one sentence.\"</span>\n)\n<span class=\"text-[#6b8afd]\">print</span>(response.output_text)</pre></div>\n<div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#303030] p-5\"><div class=\"text-[#10a37f]\">01</div><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[19px] font-semibold\">Standard keys</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#929292]\">Use for application requests. Store as environment secrets.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#303030] p-5\"><div class=\"text-[#10a37f]\">02</div><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[19px] font-semibold\">Admin keys</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#929292]\">Reserve for organization-level endpoints and controls.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#303030] p-5\"><div class=\"text-[#10a37f]\">03</div><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[19px] font-semibold\">Short-lived access</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#929292]\">Use workload identity federation for short-lived tokens.</p></div></div>\n</div></main>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden bg-[#0d0d0d] text-[#ececec]\" data-slide-title=\"The Responses API\" data-slide-type=\"content\" style=\"font-family:Inter, sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-[12px] bg-[#10a37f]\"></div><aside class=\"absolute left-[12px] top-0 h-full w-[112px] border-r border-[#282828] px-5 py-8\"><div class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#10a37f]\" style=\"writing-mode:vertical-rl;\">Responses</div></aside>\n<main class=\"ml-[160px] px-14 py-12\"><div class=\"mb-8 flex items-start justify-between\"><div><div class=\"mb-3 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#10a37f]\">05 / request anatomy</div><h2 class=\"text-[42px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]\" style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\">A request is a small, composable graph.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-[17px] text-[#929292]\">Model and input are the core. Tools and state extend the same call.</p></div><div class=\"mt-2 rounded-full bg-[#10a37f] px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-[#07130f]\">POST /v1/responses</div></div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] items-center gap-10\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#303030] bg-[#1a1a1a] p-7\"><pre class=\"m-0 text-[17px] leading-8\" style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">response = client.responses.create(\n    model=<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"gpt-5.5\"</span>,\n    input=[\n        {<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"role\"</span>: <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"user\"</span>,\n         <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"content\"</span>: <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"Summarize this contract clause...\"</span>}\n    ],\n    previous_response_id=last_id  <span class=\"text-[#777]\"># server-side state</span>\n)</pre></div>\n<div class=\"space-y-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#10231f] text-[18px] font-bold text-[#72c98b]\">01</div><div><h3 class=\"text-[19px] font-semibold\">Model</h3><p class=\"text-[14px] text-[#858585]\">Select capability and tier.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#10231f] text-[18px] font-bold text-[#72c98b]\">02</div><div><h3 class=\"text-[19px] font-semibold\">Input</h3><p class=\"text-[14px] text-[#858585]\">Send text, roles, or multimodal content.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#10231f] text-[18px] font-bold text-[#72c98b]\">03</div><div><h3 class=\"text-[19px] font-semibold\">Tools + state</h3><p class=\"text-[14px] text-[#858585]\">Add capabilities without rebuilding the interface.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border-l-4 border-[#10a37f] bg-[#10231f] p-5 text-[15px] leading-6 text-[#b5d5ca]\">No need to resend full history — state is carried by <span class=\"font-mono text-[#72c98b]\">previous_response_id</span>.</div></div></div>\n</main>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden bg-[#0d0d0d] text-[#ececec]\" data-slide-title=\"Tool use\" data-slide-type=\"content\" style=\"font-family:Inter, sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-[12px] bg-[#10a37f]\"></div><aside class=\"absolute left-[12px] top-0 h-full w-[112px] border-r border-[#282828] px-5 py-8\"><div class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#10a37f]\" style=\"writing-mode:vertical-rl;\">Tools</div></aside>\n<main class=\"ml-[160px] px-14 py-12\"><div class=\"mb-8\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#10a37f]\">06 / capabilities</div><h2 class=\"text-[42px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]\" style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\">Describe the tool. Let the model choose.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-[17px] text-[#929292]\">Function calling turns external actions into typed, inspectable interfaces.</p></div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.35fr_0.65fr] gap-8\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#303030] bg-[#1a1a1a] p-7\"><div class=\"mb-4 text-[12px] text-[#777]\">weather_tool.py</div><pre class=\"m-0 text-[15px] leading-7\" style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">tools = [{\n    <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"function\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"get_weather\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"description\"</span>: <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"Get current weather for a city\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"parameters\"</span>: {\n        <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"object\"</span>,\n        <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"properties\"</span>: {<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"city\"</span>: {<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"string\"</span>}},\n        <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"required\"</span>: [<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"city\"</span>]\n    }\n}]\nresponse = client.responses.create(\n    model=<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"gpt-5.5\"</span>, input=<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"Weather in Kathmandu?\"</span>, tools=tools\n)</pre></div>\n<div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#303030] p-5\"><div class=\"mb-2 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#10a37f]\">Your functions</div><h3 class=\"text-[19px] font-semibold\">JSON schemas</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#929292]\">Names, descriptions, properties, and required fields make the contract explicit.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#303030] p-5\"><div class=\"mb-2 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#10a37f]\">Built-in tools</div><h3 class=\"text-[19px] font-semibold\">Web search + code execution</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#929292]\">Use hosted capabilities when you do not need to operate the underlying service.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-[#10231f] p-5 text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#b5d5ca]\">Pattern: model proposes → application validates → tool executes → model explains.</div></div></div>\n</main>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden bg-[#0d0d0d] text-[#ececec]\" data-slide-title=\"Structured outputs and streaming\" data-slide-type=\"content\" style=\"font-family:Inter, sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-[12px] bg-[#10a37f]\"></div><aside class=\"absolute left-[12px] top-0 h-full w-[112px] border-r border-[#282828] px-5 py-8\"><div class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#10a37f]\" style=\"writing-mode:vertical-rl;\">Output</div></aside>\n<main class=\"ml-[160px] px-14 py-12\"><div class=\"mb-7\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#10a37f]\">07 / contracts + latency</div><h2 class=\"text-[42px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]\" style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\">Make output predictable—or immediate.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-[17px] text-[#929292]\">Structured outputs protect downstream code. Streaming protects perceived latency.</p></div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#303030] bg-[#1a1a1a] p-5\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[12px] text-[#72c98b]\">JSON schema</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#666]\">typed contract</span></div><pre class=\"m-0 text-[12px] leading-5\" style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">response = client.responses.create(\n  model=<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"gpt-5.5\"</span>,\n  input=<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"Extract name and date from: ...\"</span>,\n  text={<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"format\"</span>: {\n    <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"json_schema\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"extraction\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"schema\"</span>: {\n      <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"object\"</span>,\n      <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"properties\"</span>: {\n        <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"name\"</span>: {<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"string\"</span>},\n        <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"date\"</span>: {<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"string\"</span>}},\n      <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"required\"</span>: [<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"name\"</span>, <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"date\"</span>]}}})</pre></div>\n<div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#303030] bg-[#1a1a1a] p-5\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[12px] text-[#72c98b]\">Event stream</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#666]\">incremental UX</span></div><pre class=\"m-0 text-[13px] leading-6\" style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">stream = client.responses.create(\n  model=<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"gpt-5.5\"</span>,\n  input=<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"Write a haiku about APIs.\"</span>,\n  stream=True\n)\n<span class=\"text-[#6b8afd]\">for</span> event <span class=\"text-[#6b8afd]\">in</span> stream:\n  <span class=\"text-[#6b8afd]\">if</span> event.type == <span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"response.output_text.delta\"</span>:\n    <span class=\"text-[#6b8afd]\">print</span>(event.delta, end=<span class=\"text-[#72c98b]\">\"\"</span>)</pre><div class=\"mt-8 border-t border-[#303030] pt-4 text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#929292]\">Emit deltas as they arrive; keep the interface responsive while generation continues.</div></div></div>\n</main>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden bg-[#0d0d0d] text-[#ececec]\" data-slide-title=\"Cost optimization\" data-slide-type=\"content\" style=\"font-family:Inter, sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-[12px] bg-[#10a37f]\"></div><aside class=\"absolute left-[12px] top-0 h-full w-[112px] border-r border-[#282828] px-5 py-8\"><div class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#10a37f]\" style=\"writing-mode:vertical-rl;\">Efficiency</div></aside>\n<main class=\"ml-[160px] px-14 py-12\"><div class=\"mb-8\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#10a37f]\">08 / operating model</div><h2 class=\"text-[42px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]\" style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\">Spend follows architecture.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-[17px] text-[#929292]\">Four levers reduce token waste, queue pressure, and accidental model drift.</p></div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#303030] p-6\"><div class=\"text-[12px] text-[#10a37f]\">01 / cache</div><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[22px] font-semibold\">Prompt caching</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#929292]\">Reuse stable prefixes. Default retention is 24h for non-ZDR organizations.</p><code class=\"mt-5 block rounded-lg bg-[#1a1a1a] px-4 py-3 text-[13px] text-[#72c98b]\" style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">cache_control: {\"type\": \"ephemeral\"}</code></div>\n<div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#303030] p-6\"><div class=\"text-[12px] text-[#10a37f]\">02 / queue</div><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[22px] font-semibold\">Batch API</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#929292]\">Move non-interactive jobs to discounted asynchronous processing.</p><code class=\"mt-5 block rounded-lg bg-[#1a1a1a] px-4 py-3 text-[13px] text-[#72c98b]\" style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">POST /v1/batches</code></div>\n<div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#303030] p-6\"><div class=\"text-[12px] text-[#10a37f]\">03 / route</div><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[22px] font-semibold\">Model tiering</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#929292]\">Send simple tasks to gpt-5.4-mini or nano; reserve flagship reasoning for hard cases.</p><code class=\"mt-5 block rounded-lg bg-[#1a1a1a] px-4 py-3 text-[13px] text-[#72c98b]\" style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">router(task) → mini | nano | flagship</code></div>\n<div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#303030] p-6\"><div class=\"text-[12px] text-[#10a37f]\">04 / stabilize</div><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[22px] font-semibold\">Snapshot pinning</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#929292]\">Aliases move over time. Pin when behavior must stay stable.</p><pre class=\"mt-4 rounded-lg bg-[#1a1a1a] px-4 py-3 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#72c98b]\" style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">model=<span class=\"text-[#ececec]\">\"gpt-5.5\"</span>          <span class=\"text-[#777]\"># alias</span>\nmodel=<span class=\"text-[#ececec]\">\"gpt-5.5-2026-05\"</span>  <span class=\"text-[#777]\"># pinned</span></pre></div></div>\n</main>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden bg-[#0d0d0d] text-[#ececec]\" data-slide-title=\"Deprecations and migration\" data-slide-type=\"content\" style=\"font-family:Inter, sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-[12px] bg-[#10a37f]\"></div><aside class=\"absolute left-[12px] top-0 h-full w-[112px] border-r border-[#282828] px-5 py-8\"><div class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#10a37f]\" style=\"writing-mode:vertical-rl;\">Lifecycle</div></aside>\n<main class=\"ml-[160px] px-14 py-12\"><div class=\"mb-9\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#10a37f]\">09 / change management</div><h2 class=\"text-[42px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]\" style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\">Treat deprecation as a release event.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-[17px] text-[#929292]\">The migration window is visible now—build the habit before the deadline.</p></div>\n<div class=\"relative ml-5 border-l border-[#3c3c3c] pl-10\"><div class=\"absolute left-[-6px] top-2 h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[#10a37f]\"></div><div class=\"mb-7\"><div class=\"text-[13px] text-[#10a37f]\">MAY 2026</div><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-[21px] font-semibold\">DALL·E and Realtime Beta removed</h3></div><div class=\"absolute left-[-6px] top-[112px] h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[#10a37f]\"></div><div class=\"mb-7\"><div class=\"text-[13px] text-[#10a37f]\">SEPTEMBER 2026</div><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-[21px] font-semibold\">Sora 2 video endpoints removed</h3></div><div class=\"absolute left-[-6px] top-[224px] h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[#10a37f]\"></div><div class=\"mb-7\"><div class=\"text-[13px] text-[#10a37f]\">DECEMBER 2026</div><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-[21px] font-semibold\">Older GPT-5 and o3 snapshots removed</h3></div><div class=\"absolute left-[-6px] top-[336px] h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[#777]\"></div><div><div class=\"text-[13px] text-[#999]\">JANUARY 2027</div><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-[21px] font-semibold\">Legacy audio/transcription models removed</h3></div></div>\n<div class=\"absolute right-14 top-[245px] w-[345px] rounded-xl border border-[#303030] bg-[#151515] p-6\"><div class=\"text-[12px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#10a37f]\">Migration checklist</div><div class=\"mt-5 space-y-4 text-[15px] text-[#bdbdbd]\"><div><span class=\"mr-3 text-[#72c98b]\">01</span>Pin snapshots in production</div><div><span class=\"mr-3 text-[#72c98b]\">02</span>Watch the changelog</div><div><span class=\"mr-3 text-[#72c98b]\">03</span>Run evals before switching</div></div></div>\n</main>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden bg-[#0d0d0d] text-[#ececec]\" data-slide-title=\"Getting started\" data-slide-type=\"closing\" style=\"font-family:Inter, sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-[12px] bg-[#10a37f]\"></div><aside class=\"absolute left-[12px] top-0 h-full w-[112px] border-r border-[#282828] px-5 py-8\"><div class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#10a37f]\" style=\"writing-mode:vertical-rl;\">Start here</div></aside>\n<main class=\"ml-[160px] px-14 py-12\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#10a37f]\">10 / next steps</div><h2 class=\"text-[48px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.05em]\" style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\">Ship the smallest useful loop.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-[18px] text-[#929292]\">Get a key. Make a Responses call. Add capability only when the product needs it.</p></div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#10a37f] bg-[#10231f] p-7\"><div class=\"text-[38px] font-semibold text-[#72c98b]\" style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\">01</div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-[23px] font-semibold\">Get an API key</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] leading-6 text-[#a9bdb6]\">Create credentials and keep them in your environment—not your repository.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#303030] p-7\"><div class=\"text-[38px] font-semibold text-[#72c98b]\" style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\">02</div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-[23px] font-semibold\">Make a Responses call</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] leading-6 text-[#929292]\">Start with model + input. Add state with <span class=\"font-mono text-[#72c98b]\">previous_response_id</span>.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#303030] p-7\"><div class=\"text-[38px] font-semibold text-[#72c98b]\" style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\">03</div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-[23px] font-semibold\">Add capability</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] leading-6 text-[#929292]\">Introduce tools and structured outputs where they create product leverage.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"mt-12 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[#303030] pt-6\"><div class=\"text-[13px] text-[#777]\">Keep these tabs open</div><div class=\"flex gap-3 text-[13px]\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#3a3a3a] px-4 py-2 text-[#bdbdbd]\">developers.openai.com docs</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#3a3a3a] px-4 py-2 text-[#bdbdbd]\">API reference</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#3a3a3a] px-4 py-2 text-[#bdbdbd]\">Changelog</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#3a3a3a] px-4 py-2 text-[#bdbdbd]\">Deprecations</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"mt-10 text-[14px] text-[#10a37f]\">Build deliberately. Evaluate continuously.</div>\n</main>\n</section>"
  ]
}